items.title:
io.github.dinul2k:coalesce4j-parent 1.0.0 发布, Annotation-driven request coalescing for Java — prevents thundering-herd cache stampedes.
    When multiple concurrent threads miss the same cache key only one executes the loader;
    all others wait and share the result.

